      "sourceHash": "c1dfda4b5782c0cb",
      "translationZh": "推出 QwenGyre，将弹性强化学习引入极长时域（XLong）智能体训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c6c81ca62268734c",
      "translationZh": "它推出时具备两项核心设计：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3f7dff32eeb38dda",
      "translationZh": "弹性调度器：随着需求变化，在 rollout 与训练之间重新分配 GPU——绝不中断正在进行的执行。相较于 Colocate，最高可实现 1.85× 加速；相较于 Async，最高可实现 1.78× 加速。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4511fca08737505c",
      "translationZh": "轨迹处理器：将分支执行（上下文压缩、子智能体、重试）转换为共享前缀的轨迹树，生成数量受限且去重的训练样本。超时后已取得的部分进展仍会得到评分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c8b48f60792ed9a",
      "translationZh": "扩展至 Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B、每次 rollout 约 700K 个 token 的规模后，QwenGyre 在 48 步内将 NL2RepoBench 从 52.5% 提升至 58.5%，与 Async 相比，端到端训练时间缩短约 44%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
